{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2021-05-06 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER SCHEDULED TO PRESENT AT GOLDMAN SACHS INDUSTRIALS AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE ON MAY 11 AT 1:00 P.M. EASTERN', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MAY 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS SCHEDULED TO PRESENT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS INDUSTRIALS AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE BEING HELD VIRTUALLY ON TUESDAY, MAY 11, 2021 AT 1:00 P.M. EASTERN TIME.'}